#   header_list - HTTP::HeaderList: a response's or request's list of headers
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibHTTP/HeaderList.cpp (lines 16-354) with the inline members of
#       HeaderList.h (lines 25-91). Region r28 ported create, contains, get and append for the
#       responses phase 1 makes; region p2b the rest. HeaderList is reference counted in C++;
#       here it is managed memory its owner refers to.
#
#       HeaderList.h's three callback templates (delete_all_matching, for_each_header_value,
#       for_each_vary_header) take an ak.Function1 (DESIGN.md §2.7 case 2).
